sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(248, 245, 255) Sandbox
    actor Hook as Agent or editor hook (sandbox)
    participant CLI as git-ai checkpoint (sandbox)
    participant Policy as Daemon start policy
    end
    box rgb(241, 248, 255) Host and host-owned persistence
    participant Daemon as Host daemon sockets
    participant Outbox as Private shared outbox
    participant Log as Working log
    end

    Hook->>CLI: Hook input
    CLI->>CLI: Parse preset and capture CheckpointRequest
    CLI->>CLI: Apply all-or-nothing repository allowlist

    alt Repository collection denied
        CLI-->>Hook: Exit 0, no IPC and no persisted payload
    else Repository collection allowed
        CLI->>CLI: Assign delivery ID before any socket attempt
        CLI->>Daemon: Probe control and trace sockets

        alt Existing host daemon is reachable
            CLI->>Daemon: checkpoint.deliver(envelope)
        else Host daemon is unavailable
            CLI->>Policy: May this process start a daemon?

            alt Detached startup is safe
                Policy->>Daemon: Start host daemon
                CLI->>Daemon: Retry live delivery once
            else Detached startup is disallowed
                Note over CLI,Policy: Auto-start is disabled or a strong sandbox marker blocks detached startup
            end
        end

        alt response.ok is true
            Daemon->>Log: Validate, deduplicate, sequence, and durably apply
            Log-->>Daemon: Durable success
            Daemon-->>CLI: ok: true
            CLI-->>Hook: Exit 0, no outbox record
        else No ok: true acknowledgement
            Note over CLI,Daemon: Includes no endpoint, timeout, disconnect, ok: false, current request, and remaining unsent requests
            Note over CLI,Outbox: Outbox is a host-owned path explicitly mounted writable into the sandbox
            Note over CLI,Daemon: The host may already have applied the delivery, so replay deduplicates by delivery ID
            CLI->>Outbox: Write private CBOR temp record
            CLI->>Outbox: fsync file, rename ready, fsync directory

            alt Durable publication succeeds
                Outbox-->>CLI: Ready record is durable
                CLI-->>Hook: Exit 0, preserved for host replay
            else Publication fails, is full, or is unsafe
                Outbox-->>CLI: Error
                CLI->>CLI: Record redacted loss sentinel and warning
                CLI-->>Hook: Exit 0, attribution was not preserved
            end
        end
    end
